        },
        {
          "text": "UMose wakhetha amadoda anamandla ku-Israyeli wonke, wawamisa aba izinhloko phezu kwabantu, izinduna zezinkulungwane, nezinduna zamakhulu, nezinduna zamashumi amahlanu nezinduna zeshumi.",
